== Lattice input: string breaking
#grid(
  columns: (auto, 1fr),
  column-gutter: 1em,
  align: horizon,
  scale(64%, reflow: true, lattice-levels-plot()),
  [
    Matrix potential (Bulava et al. 2024):
    $
      mat(
        delim: "(",
        V(r), #text(fill: red)[$sqrt(2) g_l$], g_s;
        #text(fill: red)[$sqrt(2) g_l$], hat(E)_1, 0;
        g_s, 0, hat(E)_2
      )
    $
    #text(
      size: 15pt,
    )[basis ${macron(b)b, B macron(B), B_s macron(B)_s}$, #h(0.3em) $g_l = 35.0(5)_"stat" (3)_"sys"$ MeV]
  ],
)
Lattice $B macron(B)$ operator, projected onto $lr(|j_ell, lambda_ell chevron.r)$ and $lr(|s_(macron(b)b), m_(macron(b)b) chevron.r)$:
$
  lr(|B macron(B) chevron.r) = 1/2 lr(|0_ell, 0 chevron.r) lr(|0_(macron(b)b), 0 chevron.r)
  + 1/2 sum_(lambda_ell = plus.minus 1, 0) (-1)^(lambda_ell + 1) lr(|1_ell, lambda_ell chevron.r) lr(|1_(macron(b)b), -lambda_ell chevron.r)
$
$
  g = underbrace(2, lr(|1_ell\, 0 chevron.r) lr(|1_(macron(b)b)\, 0 chevron.r) "term") times underbrace(1 / sqrt(3), Sigma_g^(+') -> S"-wave") times underbrace(sqrt(2) g_l, "lattice") = #text(fill: red)[$57 "MeV"$]
$

== Application of BO$chi$EFT to $X_b$
LO potential in the $1^(++)$ sector, $alpha = 1, 2, 3$ for $B macron(B)^*(""^3S_1), B macron(B)^*(""^3D_1), B^* macron(B)^*(""^5D_1)$:
$
  V_(alpha' alpha)(p', p) = delta_(alpha' 1) delta_(alpha 1) V_S^(macron(b)b + op("CT"))(p', p) + V_(alpha' alpha)^"(OME)" (p', p)
$

LSE with nonrelativistic two-body Green's functions:
$
  T_(alpha' alpha)(p', p) = V_(alpha' alpha)(p', p) - sum_(alpha'') integral_0^Lambda (q^2 d q)/(2pi^2) V_(alpha' alpha'')(p', q) G_(alpha'')(k, q) T_(alpha'' alpha)(q, p) \
